== Q4 verdict
ASSIGNABILITY: ASSIGNABLE
  reason: hosts are proxy clients reading a shared SM credential with a per-run sticky session id, so a new host needs only an IAM read grant -- class MEASURED for the client model; INFERRED that BD zone has no caller-IP allowlist or session cap
BLOCKED NON-AWS SOCKETS: 0
